        <article data-uid="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI">
  
  
  <h1 id="GameFramework_ConsoleTool_ConsoleGUI" data-uid="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI" class="text-break">
    Class ConsoleGUI
    
  </h1>
  
  <div class="facts text-secondary">
    <dl><dt>Namespace</dt><dd><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.html">GameFramework.ConsoleTool</a></dd></dl>
    <dl><dt>Assembly</dt><dd>cs.temp.dll.dll</dd></dl>
  </div>
  
  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Console GUI component responsible for rendering console UI and handling user input.</p>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="4" sourceendlinenumber="4">Architecture:</p>
<ul sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="8">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="5">Pure UI component - only handles visual representation</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="6" sourceendlinenumber="6">Subscribes to console-specific input events (not toggle - that&apos;s handled by ConsoleService)</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="7" sourceendlinenumber="7">Uses events to communicate back to console system</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="8" sourceendlinenumber="8">Optimized string building for better performance</li>
</ul>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="10" sourceendlinenumber="10">Input Handling Flow:</p>
<ol sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="14">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="11">InputManager detects console input (submit, tab, history) </li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="12" sourceendlinenumber="12">InputManager publishes console input events</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="13" sourceendlinenumber="13">ConsoleGUI receives events and updates UI accordingly</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="14" sourceendlinenumber="14">ConsoleGUI calls Console static methods to execute commands</li>
</ol>
</div>
  <div class="markdown conceptual"></div>

  <div class="codewrapper">
    <pre><code class="lang-csharp hljs">public class ConsoleGUI : MonoBehaviour, IConsoleUI</code></pre>
  </div>
  
  
  
  
